OL,3,GNEWSACall for review of Reform UK's
OL,4,Acouncil flag policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn opposition leader on Kirklees
OL,7,FCouncil has urged its leadership team
OL,8,Fto "review" its latest policy on which
OL,9,Fflags can be flown on public buildings.
OL,11,FThe Reform UK-led authority approved a
OL,12,Fmove that meant only a limited range of
OL,13,Fdesigns could be flown. The new policy
OL,14,Fmeans the Pride flag, often considered
OL,15,Fa symbol of LGBTQ+ visibility, will not
OL,16,Fbe on any town hall flagpoles.
OL,18,FCouncil leader Sarah Wood said the move
OL,19,Fwas to "set out a clear approach across
OL,20,FKirklees".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
