OL,3,GNEWSACall for review of Reform UK's
OL,4,Acouncil flag policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a letter to Wood, councillor Anthony
OL,7,FSmith, leader of the Liberal Democrats,
OL,8,Fsaid Kirklees had "a proud civic
OL,9,Ftradition of inclusion, mutual respect,
OL,10,Fand celebrating the diverse communities
OL,11,Fthat make up our towns and villages".
